kebLKvBV-bEQ7kNvwEpkoV7&_nc_oc=AdrcHTHIkQ5sy4HY5hJGgYSAleZDPEI6tKXKSaZyT6kAHB9kK757JPr3uAWey_nHTwg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2p-rlHRMNRhJ4_OJJfMgM0keiuv48PXH0tcN9z_xP9jQ&oe=69D662B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-YXYVBWn_64Q7kNvwF4gRRd&_nc_oc=AdrzerWMhN0HrduBJc5tDEBBvOHyb6peiK-K9ue6JGDWA4SBW3VUB4uFxR832zc9rA4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3zKu9i9w8XMDBAtcRS_pvHBtolrdzXD3ojJJ_b1iY4Tg&oe=69D6644A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oCAQJ6UBx4YQ7kNvwHt62tt&_nc_oc=AdpPITxxFUeGqe4HvTqC2zLH_TxjQDrWWkfWmbQ92cKDVfIvZgbAAPU-_LbfNcxAeoA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3NR3DJw6iuluRT6uUJxNo_1Jv-zT71Sf1EScNk5P7nbw&oe=69D6516F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vE8CvjXTI58Q7kNvwHqkETj&_nc_oc=AdqRct9QceaOEx4K_nRatMXjuegUjnhI-bj9KlylSHmsjP2BaeSLwRSZ8Y-Oytq9Ft8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2g63qFqsf-86tpVgYwK4ceByYGxt3xJ0uEs3Mei5ua3Q&oe=69D63AC3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ETc5HCmHrS8Q7kNvwEE_sMX&_nc_oc=AdoDEUB5WhKUS-rQfjzNTyFmRwBpuZ4tLZLNVzOW6M8UELTuHT5TlpUVGq9UIvwJtOk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2geBJuemWBXA4Ih0fnuBOEiOWnFHrVCoRkA8KYKMfiRA&oe=69D63318"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K_3pKAp00vsQ7kNvwEdqxw4&_nc_oc=AdrO1v1YiHVk-3DwlcEuzhuLwIGDRuU4yqbc9QGVtysTRtimB5w7GFvZtbdz0ixO-RM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3aIQAGyBWQ1LIhyG0ybfLRfD9m4hafSL7f5ppuIPcBVw&oe=69D6463C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080